WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.877
(sad music)

00:00:14.161 --> 00:00:14.994
(breaking glass)

00:00:14.994 --> 00:00:17.696
- Hey, how is everything going in here?

00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:18.529
- Yeah, you know,

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:19.924
just getting some last-minute things done

00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:21.349
before we take her.

00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:24.547
I'm gonna take her to all
of her favorite places

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:26.051
and then I'm gonna spread her ashes.

00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:27.999
- And I'm here to celebrate her life

00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:31.346
by fulfilling her last dying wish of

00:00:31.346 --> 00:00:32.798
finishing this bar cart

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:35.967
and watching her favorite
show, The Husband Did It.

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:37.938
- Yes, okay, that is lovely.

00:00:37.938 --> 00:00:40.586
She was so lucky to have
two great granddaughters

00:00:40.586 --> 00:00:43.132
like you.
- [Brunette Woman] No, no, no.

00:00:43.132 --> 00:00:44.282
- We were the lucky ones.

00:00:44.282 --> 00:00:45.605
(crying)
- Oh my God.

00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:47.077
I was her granddaughter,

00:00:47.077 --> 00:00:48.439
she was my nanna
- Our grandma.

00:00:48.439 --> 00:00:49.282
- She was my nanna.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.205
- She was our nanna.

00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:51.405
- We are not related.

00:00:51.405 --> 00:00:52.924
It was...
- She actually loved me.

00:00:52.924 --> 00:00:54.382
- She's my nanna by blood.

00:00:54.382 --> 00:00:55.720
- She told me that before she passed.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.611
- [Brunette Woman] She did not say that.

00:00:56.611 --> 00:00:58.532
- Why are you yelling at me.

00:00:58.532 --> 00:01:00.249
- Oh my God.
- I'm hurting too.

00:01:00.249 --> 00:01:01.465
- [Brunette Woman] All right!

00:01:01.465 --> 00:01:04.132
(dubstep music)

00:01:08.051 --> 00:01:09.634
All right, you know what?

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:11.051
I'm gonna get going
cause there's not a lot

00:01:11.051 --> 00:01:13.061
of time before sundown.

00:01:13.061 --> 00:01:15.244
I want you to take my phone.

00:01:15.244 --> 00:01:17.304
I want it to be just me and nanna today.

00:01:17.304 --> 00:01:18.850
So.
- Okay.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:20.025
- Also, thank you for helping.

00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:21.623
- Wait!

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:22.456
Here.

00:01:23.815 --> 00:01:24.864
Shots for nanna.

00:01:24.864 --> 00:01:25.835
- Oh.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:26.668
- To our nanna.

00:01:26.668 --> 00:01:27.634
- To my nanna
- Our nanna.

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:28.467
- Kelsey.
- Our nanna.

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:29.317
- To my nanna, for the love of God.

00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:30.150
- Our...

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.066
- My nanna.
- Our nanna.

00:01:31.066 --> 00:01:32.527
- Okay.

00:01:32.527 --> 00:01:34.451
(spits loudly)

00:01:34.451 --> 00:01:35.586
- Jesus!

00:01:35.586 --> 00:01:36.674
- Why was it a solid?

00:01:36.674 --> 00:01:37.894
- How long have these been sitting here?

00:01:37.894 --> 00:01:40.081
- I could feel my breath through my nose.

00:01:40.081 --> 00:01:42.789
(dubstep music)

00:01:42.789 --> 00:01:45.420
Okay, gran, are you ready
to have the best day ever?

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.795
Besides, you know, the
fact that you're dead.

00:01:47.795 --> 00:01:50.918
(dramatic music)

00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:53.142
