00:01:58.495 --> 00:02:01.729
- (laughs) It's not the brother.

00:02:01.729 --> 00:02:03.312
The husband did it!

00:02:04.537 --> 00:02:06.495
God, I like it every time. (laughs)

00:02:06.495 --> 00:02:09.245
