00:02:43.504 --> 00:02:45.954
(laughs nervously)

00:02:45.954 --> 00:02:47.879
- So, you didn't give us nanna?

00:02:47.879 --> 00:02:48.712
- Yes.

00:02:48.712 --> 00:02:49.599
- Yes you did, or yes you didn't?

00:02:49.599 --> 00:02:50.581
- Didn't.
- Didn't?

00:02:50.581 --> 00:02:52.106
- Yes.
- You didn't give us nanna?

00:02:52.106 --> 00:02:55.955
- We didn't not switcher-whoops,
to put it plainly.

00:02:55.955 --> 00:02:57.726
- Just say that slower down for me.

00:02:57.726 --> 00:02:59.593
- We didn't give you the correct urn.

00:02:59.593 --> 00:03:03.010
