00:03:05.768 --> 00:03:07.763
(mumbles from phone)

00:03:07.763 --> 00:03:08.747
Oh

00:03:08.747 --> 00:03:09.943
my

00:03:09.943 --> 00:03:10.776
God.

00:03:13.188 --> 00:03:14.021
Come on.

00:03:15.704 --> 00:03:17.437
Pick up, pick up, pick up, pick up.

00:03:17.437 --> 00:03:19.146
