Fuck!

00:03:19.146 --> 00:03:20.272
Okay.

00:03:20.272 --> 00:03:21.406
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.

00:03:21.406 --> 00:03:24.094
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.

00:03:24.094 --> 00:03:25.347
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.

00:03:25.347 --> 00:03:28.416
Damn it, I don't know where they are!

00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:32.695
Okay, when you're lost, it's
best to stay in one place.

00:03:32.695 --> 00:03:33.528
Okay, shit!

00:03:33.528 --> 00:03:34.411
